Below is a concise checklist of improvements you can make to harden the current code base. The suggestions are grouped by *error handling*, *input validation / sanitisation*, and broader *security best‑practice* measures. Each item includes a short “why” and a concrete code change (or add‑on) you can copy‑paste.

