| ✅ | Item |
|----|------|
| ✅ | Use **Helmet** (already added) |
| ✅ | Enable **CORS** with a strict whitelist |
| ✅ | Add **Rate limiting** per IP |
| ✅ | Validate **all** query, path, and body parameters (e.g., `express-validator`, `joi`, or `zod`) |
