| ✅ | Implement **Content‑Security‑Policy** if you ever serve HTML/JS. |
| ✅ | Enable **CSRF protection** for state‑changing POST/PUT/DELETE routes (`csurf` or same‑site cookies). |
| ✅ | Consider **Helmet’s `hidePoweredBy`** or set `app.disable('x-powered-by')` if you want to hide the Express banner. |

