|--------|------------------------------|
| **`helmet()`** – sets `Content‑Security‑Policy`, `X‑Content‑Type‑Options`, etc. | Mitigates XSS, click‑jacking, MIME‑sniffing, etc. |
| **`cors()`** with configurable origins | Prevents unwanted cross‑origin requests. |
| **`express.json({ limit })`** | Stops huge payload attacks (DOS). |
| **`morgan`** | Gives you an audit trail to spot abnormal traffic. |
