| **CORS** – whitelist only the domains that should call the API | Prevents other sites from using your API without permission | `npm i cors` <br>```js const cors = require('cors'); app.use(cors({ origin: ['https://my‑frontend.example.com'], methods: ['GET'] }));``` |
| **Body‑parser / express.json()** (even if you only have GET now) | Guarantees JSON parsing errors are caught early | `app.use(express.json());` |
