| **Graceful shutdown** (listen for SIGTERM/SIGINT) | Prevents abrupt termination that could leave sockets hanging or corrupt state | ```js\nprocess.on('SIGTERM', () => server.close(() => console.log('✅ Server closed')));\n``` |

