## 5. Security‑Centric Configuration

| Setting | Recommendation |
|---------|----------------|
| **HTTPS only** – enforce TLS at the front‑end proxy (NGINX/Traefik) and redirect any plain‑HTTP requests. |
| **Hide Express “X‑Powered‑By” header** | `app.disable('x-powered-by');` |
| **Content‑Security‑Policy** (via Helmet) – restrict script sources, `default-src 'self'`. |
| **Referrer‑Policy** – `no-referrer` or `same-origin`. |
| **Feature‑Policy / Permissions‑Policy** – turn off geolocation, camera, etc., unless needed. |
| **Environment variables for secrets** – never hard‑code tokens/DB passwords; read them from `process.env`. |
| **Dependency hygiene** – run `npm audit` and keep packages up‑to‑date. Consider `npm audit fix` or using `dependabot`. |

